  id: through_the_portal
  displayName: Into the Misty Woods
  description: 'Sigrid''s voice came through the stones: Ingrid is hurt, and close. Step through the portal and reach an extraction point before it closes. What you wear comes home with you whatever happens. What you carry is lost if you fall.'
  chain: The Hearth and the Door
  journalNotes: 'Your first raid. Put anything precious in your safe pocket, and turn back earlier than feels necessary. A hatchet and a pick let you bring hardwood and ore home as well as people.


    Finding Ingrid counts even when the raid goes wrong: she waits where you found her.'
